{"id": "EUVD-2026-76613", "enisaUuid": "031016a7-279e-30cc-acd2-428bc863d768", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnfsd: validate nseconds in TIME_DELEG decode paths\n\nThe xdrgen-based TIME_DELEG_ACCESS and TIME_DELEG_MODIFY decode arms\nstore a raw uint32_t nseconds directly into tv_nsec without enforcing\nnseconds < NSEC_PER_SEC. The legacy nfsd4_decode_nfstime4 has this\ncheck but the TIME_DELEG paths do not. A malformed timespec can\npropagate through notify_change() to disk.\n\nAdd range checks in both nfs4xdr.c (SETATTR path) and\nnfs4callback.c (CB_GETATTR path).", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:46:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:51:14", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7e7b93da7fa2e77f977096251899d1410986adf6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5eb489831a9fd4754f4baf26e6989efb66ce104c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f4a767340fad392bd656115b8752005518c9065"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pqvp-pfwp-hf4c", "CVE-2026-89701"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0357c346-6b72-3815-adde-5b63904f9af0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "38041024-eb37-3c33-8597-a2d843ddf898", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6ae30d6eb26bce02c48c60074b4306270e2434c1 <7e7b93da7fa2e77f977096251899d1410986adf6"}, {"id": "47eb08a9-7e2b-359c-a801-cec64c0105bd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "4a79f5a1-ce07-3353-a396-5420835d75c3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.14"}, {"id": "4ae0fa1a-16b3-31f9-a639-964490da26af", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "806cef1d-5ea5-3e69-a392-2ff212565cbd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "b53de1b3-6293-359b-b351-f0952ee05da7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6ae30d6eb26bce02c48c60074b4306270e2434c1 <5eb489831a9fd4754f4baf26e6989efb66ce104c"}, {"id": "da173708-5407-3798-9507-0cc3c34287d1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6ae30d6eb26bce02c48c60074b4306270e2434c1 <0f4a767340fad392bd656115b8752005518c9065"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ae2f4eed-faec-3396-9696-f8360510b5ec", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}